# =================================================== #


DataFrame students:

+-------------+--------+
| Column Name | Type   |
+-------------+--------+
| student_id  | int    |
| name        | object |
| age         | int    |
| grade       | float  |
+-------------+--------+

Write a solution to correct the errors:

The grade column is stored as floats, convert it to integers.


# =================================================== #
                      SOLUTION
# =================================================== #


import pandas as pd

def changeDatatype(students: pd.DataFrame) -> pd.DataFrame:
    
    students['grade'] = students['grade'].astype(int)

    return students
